O: 100, 100, -1000

// 正面：直线，左右两个直条安全区 Omen: Rect Tag: M8s_转盘_${n: (${dirN5} + 0) % 5}L_侧 t: ${t} θ: dir2rad(${dirN5}, -5) + 0 * π/5 Pos: 7, -8 Scale: 1, 16 --- Omen: Rect Tag: M8s_转盘_${n: (${dirN5} + 0) % 5}R_侧 t: ${t} θ: dir2rad(${dirN5}, -5) + 0 * π/5 Pos: -7, -8 Scale: 1, 16 ---
