// 右后：大扇环，前方两个 30 扇形安全区 Omen: Fan30 Tag: M8s_转盘_${n: (${dirN5} + 2) % 5}L_前 t: ${t} θ: dir2rad(${dirN5}, -5) + 4 * π/5 Angle: π - 15° Scale: 16 --- Omen: Fan30 Tag: M8s_转盘_${n: (${dirN5} + 2) % 5}R_前 t: ${t} θ: dir2rad(${dirN5}, -5) + 4 * π/5 Angle: π + 15° Scale: 16 ---
// 左后：钢铁，后方两个 40 扇环安全区 Omen: m0559donut_o0v Tag: M8s_转盘_${n: (${dirN5} + 3) % 5}L_后 t: ${t} θ: dir2rad(${dirN5}, -5) + 6 * π/5 Angle: π - 20° Scale: 22 / 0.75 --- Omen: m0559donut_o0v Tag: M8s_转盘_${n: (${dirN5} + 3) % 5}R_后 t: ${t} θ: dir2rad(${dirN5}, -5) + 6 * π/5 Angle: π + 20° Scale: 22 / 0.75 ---
